# 🛡️ Phishing Detection & Email Threat Analyzer

> 🚧 **Status: Under Construction**

A cybersecurity project focused on analyzing emails to identify potential **phishing attempts and other email-based threats**.

The system is being developed to analyze different aspects of an email, including:

* 📧 Email headers
* 🔐 SPF, DKIM, and DMARC authentication
* 🔗 URLs and domains
* 📎 Email attachments
* 🔎 Indicators of Compromise (IOCs)
* 🌐 Threat intelligence and reputation information
* 🤖 NLP/ML-based suspicious email classification

The analyzed information will be combined to generate a **risk score** and provide security analysts with useful information about why an email may be considered suspicious.

### 🔬 Planned Workflow

```text
Email
  │
  ├── Header Analysis
  ├── SPF / DKIM / DMARC
  ├── URL & Domain Analysis
  ├── Attachment Analysis
  ├── IOC Extraction
  └── Reputation Analysis
          │
          ▼
    NLP / ML Analysis
          │
          ▼
       Risk Score
          │
          ▼
    Analyst Dashboard
```

The project is currently **under active development**, and additional analysis capabilities, machine-learning functionality, threat-intelligence integrations, and dashboard features will be added progressively.

### 🎯 Goal

The goal of this project is to build an **automated and explainable email threat-analysis platform** that can assist security analysts in identifying and investigating suspicious emails.
